(Kampong Thom): Ms. Khuon Khundy, Senator and Chair of the Kampong Svay District Field Team, Kampong Thom Province, led a group of volunteer doctors of the French Humanitarian Mission Association in Cambodia to treat people in Sankor Commune, Kampong Svay District. Charge for 2 days from December 6 to 7, 2022.
