(Phnom Penh): Three armed thieves were arrested by the police after cutting a young man, causing serious head injuries, to rob a model while the victim was sitting talking on the phone On a motorcycle.
Mr. Say Chamroeun, Chief of Choam Chao I Police Station, told Fresh News Agency that this incident happened at 9:25 pm on December 4, 2022 at Veal Dey, Kork Chambok Village, Sangkat Choam Chao I, Khan Por Sen Chey. . The operation was carried out by the Khan Special Forces in collaboration with the Post Force led by Mr. Morn Vuthy, Por Sen Chey District Inspector, under the direct command of Lt. Gen. Thet, Deputy Commissioner General and Phnom Penh Municipal Police.
