Please be informed that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, on the evening of December 1, 2022, through the official Facebook, Samdech sent a message to the Cambodian people to confirm the budget situation to support demining in Cambodia. With a total budget of approximately $ 18,473,570, which is a royal gift from the King and Queen Mother, as well as philanthropists for demining to be paid by the morning of December 1, 2022.
To ensure that Cambodia will run out of landmines by 2025, Samdech discussed with Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth, Minister of Economy and Finance, the release of $ 30 million from the Royal Government's Savings Fund to the Mine and Unexploded Ordnance Fund, which is controlled by Ministry of Economy and Finance.
With the dropping of the national budget of $ 30 million into the demining program, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also continued to call on philanthropists to participate as much as possible so that in 2025, Cambodia will be mine-free, provide land safely and with a smile to the people.
