December 6, 2022, the second day in the morning, there are two subjects: 90 minutes of mathematics and 90 minutes of ethics, 90 minutes. In the afternoon, there is one subject, Khmer literature, lasting 150 minutes.
For Science Class: Subjects to be examined on December 5, 2022, the first day in the morning, there are two subjects: History 60 minutes and Biology 90 minutes. In the afternoon, there are two subjects: 90 minutes of chemistry and 60 minutes of foreign language.
December 6, 2022, the second day in the morning, there are two subjects: Khmer literature for 90 minutes and Physics for 90 minutes. In the afternoon, there is a 150-minute math course.
