During the meeting, Duke Ly Samet also reminded the workers about the value of peace. The tycoon emphasized that because Cambodia was peaceful, there was investment to build factories and enterprises. It is the presence of these factories that provide jobs and income for workers to sustain their livelihoods and improve their lives.
