Dr. Uy Chanthol, Chairman of the Siem Reap Provincial Medical Council, told Fresh News on December 3, 2022 that the Siem Reap Provincial Medical Council has cooperated with the authorities to detain a fake doctor who injected drugs into a girl. Died on December 1, 2022.
The fake doctor who was detained by the police was named We Vy, who lives in Tonle Sor village, Nokorpheas commune, Nokor Chum district, Siem Reap province. He was a worker at the health center more than 10 years ago. The authorities have already called him to make a contract three times so that he can stop doing this business, but he still steals and injects drugs to the villagers. Be a citizen.
At the same time, Dr. Uy Chanthol urged all non-doctors to stop doing business by turning to other professions or professions that they know, please do not practice medicine. Because we are not doctors, which leads to convictions and imprisonment.
In addition, the Siem Reap Provincial Medical Council would like to thank the authorities of the Provincial Health Department and the OD, which always helps the Provincial Medical Council to achieve its goals and for the health of the people. Please note that the perpetrator named Wevy is currently preparing a case to proceed with legal proceedings. Prey Veng Provincial Administration Announces No Fee for Transportation of Students Who Fail the Baccalaureate Exam
