(Kratie): Mr. Chhoeun Bunnaroth, Member of Party Central Committee and Chairman of Kratie Municipal Party Working Group and Ms. Sao Sokuntheary, Deputy Chairman of Kratie Municipal Party Working Group, held a meeting on December 2, 2022. And summarizing the work for November 2022 at the Kratie Provincial Party Office.
On that occasion, Mr. Chhoeun Bonnaroth set 10 directions with the following main contents:
* First, as a member of the Cambodian People's Party, must take a stand to condemn the three generations of traitors Sam Rainsy who seriously insulted the power of the Khmer King.
* Second, despite the good control of the spread of Kovid 19, we must continue to work to promote and encourage the local people to get more vaccinated as the status of Kovid 19 is still high. Continuing and threatening the health of the people.
* Thirdly, to be able to disseminate the great achievements of the Royal Government, such as Cambodia has achieved great success and achieved historically brilliant results as the chair of the 40th and 41st ASEAN Summits.
* Fifth: To be able to take advantage by disseminating the cash support of the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party to the people in need during the fight against Kovid 19.
* Sixth: Try to resolve disputes outside the judiciary as much as possible.
* Seventh: Organize informal economic forces.
* Eighth: Continue to expand and strengthen party members and clearly identify migrant members.
Ninth: All Sangkat Councils must work together to serve the people to the best of their ability by using the Sangkat Development Budget to be transparent, efficient and effective.
10th: To prepare the expenditure plan for the time of the election campaign for the 7th National Assembly election in 2023 from now on.
