Cambodia, Slovakia hold second bilateral consultation meeting
In terms of bilateral cooperation, the two sides are committed to boosting potential bilateral cooperation through the exchange of business delegations, including the two countries' chambers of commerce, and further expanding mutual support within the framework of the organization. International.
