This statement by Mr. Men Vibol was made this morning, December 2, 2022, on the occasion that he and Mr. Chum Hat, Deputy Chairman of the Provincial Front Committee, presided over the celebration of the 44th birthday. United Front for the Development of Motherland Cambodia (December 2, 1978 / December 2, 2022) at the CPP meeting hall in Svay Rieng province, consisting of 897 monks and members.
He said that the "United Front for the National Salvation of Cambodia" is now renamed the "United Front for the Development of Motherland Cambodia", a leading mass organization of the Cambodian People's Party was established in the liberated area in Cheung Khlou village, commune 2. Thnou, Snoul district, Kratie province.
The spirit of December 2 and the spirit of January 7 will remain immortal in the hearts of the younger generation as well as all Cambodians, especially to remember this unforgettable day, because today our veterans have sacrificed their blood. Fresh and fresh meat to liberate the people and the nation from the pit of death, the black shirts.
On that occasion, the Governor of Kratie Province thanked and commended all the leaders and members of the Kratie Homeland Development Front Committee and the authorities of all levels of administration, especially the authorities of Snuol district administration and the six commune administrations for their cooperation. Close to organizing this event with more than 5,000 members participating.
The provincial governor confirmed that the United Front for National Salvation of Cambodia was established in order to liberate the country from the Pol Pot regime, save the lives of the people from the catastrophe of the black shirt regime and restore the development of the motherland of Cambodia and not only save lives The lives of the people not only survived the catastrophe of the regime, but also helped restore, build and develop the motherland of Cambodia to a new face to this day.
"The December 2 Front was the only great ancestor who came to the great victory on January 7, 1979, which pushed for win-win politics, peace, stability, national unity and real development," he said. But to this day, we have come a long way through many difficulties and obstacles. Many Cambodian dignitaries, fighters and patriots have sacrificed their lives to sacrifice fresh flesh and blood in the cause of the motherland without regretting their lives. ”
He added that over the past several decades, Cambodia under the right leadership and long-term vision of the Cambodian People's Party, especially the win-win policy that Samdech Techo Hun Sen has made the whole country. There is complete peace.
