17-year-old girl dies after getting out of bed
(Svay Rieng): To the surprise of the family and the villagers this morning, after a girl accidentally got out of bed, the floor broke on the power outage and died tragically. This incident happened at 4:30 AM on December 1, 2022 in Trabek Phong village, Ta Suos commune, Svay Chrum district.
According to the district police, the victim was a 17-year-old girl named Se Srey Doeun, a student living in the commune.
Before the incident, the girl woke up as usual to help sell porridge to shoot. Later, there was a surprise that the girl was electrocuted, causing surprise to the family and the villagers came to the rescue, but unfortunately it was too late, while getting down from the bed on the power outlet, causing an electric shock. Right next to the bed.
Later, the district police, in cooperation with the administrative police and doctors, came down to examine the body, concluding that it was indeed electrocuted, so the authorities handed it over to the family for the traditional ceremony. A second-year student was stabbed to death by an acquaintance in a rented room in Kampong Cham
(Kampong Cham): A second year student at Western University, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province, was stabbed to death by a man who was an acquaintance and used to study together at a secondary school in a rented room in Sangkat Veal Vong, Kampong Cham City. The assailant was arrested by police immediately after the action.
This incident caused a surprise on the morning of December 1, 2022, after the police received a report that there was a case of violence in his rented room, which rented a girl to stay in school.
Immediately after receiving the information, Colonel Eung Bun, Police Inspector of Kampong Cham, ordered the specialized force of the Inspectorate, Veal Vong Administration Post Force, in cooperation with the specialized force of the Provincial Criminal Police Plan to arrive at the scene to inspect. When the force arrived at the scene, they found a person holding a knife.
With suspicion, the police immediately arrested the suspect and checked in the room, there were blood stains on the tiles and found in the bathroom (rented room) that there was a woman's body, so the police assumed that it was a murder case. According to the owner of the rented room, the victim is 20-year-old Viet Chantra, a second-year student at Western University and resides in Steng Chey Village, Cheung Prey District, Kampong Cham Province.
In this case, the competent authorities detained and brought the suspect to the Police Inspectorate of Kampong Cham City to continue to build a case according to the procedure.
