(Phnom Penh): Mr. Leang Monirith, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, on December 1, 2022, highlighted that the Ministry has issued 3,176 construction permits nationwide under an investment of $ 1.963 million. In the first 9 months of 2022.
This emphasis was made on the occasion of Mr. Leang Monirith, Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, inaugurating the regular meeting and inauguration of the Cambodia-International Construction Industry Exhibition 2022 organized by the Cambodian Builders Association. At the Koh Pich Exhibition Center this morning, December 1, 2022.
He pointed out that the Ministry has issued permits for the construction of 20 housing projects in the form of Borey, has issued permits for the construction of 98 high-rise buildings from 5 floors, equivalent to 100 buildings, of which 63 in Phnom Penh, the province. Sihanoukville 11 projects, Banteay Meanchey 12 projects and in other provinces 12 projects.
He said that over the last decade, investment in the construction sector in Cambodia has grown steadily and continues to grow, especially the construction of high-rise buildings such as condominiums, shopping malls, business centers, office buildings. Hotels, multi-functional buildings, housing estates, villas, educational institutions, hospitals, banks, factories, warehouses, etc.
At the same time, Mr. Leang Monirith also called on architects, engineers, consultants, builders, compensation managers and real estate developers to adhere to professional ethics, adhere to the rules, regulations, construction techniques and technical standards related to the construction sector. To ensure safety, hygiene, environment, aesthetics and construction quality.
In addition, Mr. Leang Monirith told to continue to contribute to the economic, social and cultural development of the nation according to their knowledge, desires and skills.
Neak Oknha Pung Kheav Se, President of the Cambodian Builders Association, pointed out that in Phnom Penh and Sihanoukville, modern high-rise buildings have grown exponentially, such as commercial centers, offices, banks, shopping malls and hotels. Many condominiums and housing estates have been built in succession.
According to Duke Pung Kheavse, these constructions are modern and use all the technology and equipment in the construction, all of them are of good quality and modern technical and have the right standards, not inferior to other countries in the country. Southeast Asia, and these buildings turned into a beautiful city.
He added that all this shows that domestic and foreign investors have seen the political stability and economic growth of Cambodia, as well as high confidence in Cambodia under the leadership of the Royal Government. Techo Hun Sen is the Prime Minister of Cambodia.
Duke Pung Kheav Se said that under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, all investors and developers have decided to invest heavily in the construction and real estate sector in Cambodia.
A Khmer Krom youth decides to join politics with the Cambodian People's Party
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Soeung Sotheany, originally named Thach Teang, 41 years old, a son of Khmer Krom, decided to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party because he saw the values of this ruling party has the right ideals and the right path for excellence. National interest and the people of Cambodia.
The inauguration ceremony of Mr. Soeung Sotheany, a member of the Cambodian People's Party, was held this morning, December 1, 2022, at the headquarters of the Cambodian People's Party in Phnom Penh, presided over by Mr. Nuth, a permanent member of the CPP Committee and Chairman. Local Party Committee, Phnom Penh Party Department.
During the CPP's inauguration ceremony this morning, Mr. Soeung Sotheany highlighted that he had closely monitored the leadership of the CPP and assessed that only the CPP Have the right ideals and have a great end for the motherland.
With the reasons given for joining the political life with the Cambodian People's Party, the young man born in the Khmer Kampuchea Krom territory is also committed to contributing to the maintenance of peace to further improve the national economy. Take into account personal interests, status, any role.
Please note that Mr. Soeung Sotheany or Thach Tieng was born in Phirum Sok village, Ototeung commune, Kampong Spean district, Preah Trapeang province, Kampuchea Krom. He currently lives in Sangkat Dangkor, Khan Dangkor, Phnom Penh.
Mr. Soeung Sotheany came to Phnom Penh during 2000 to study in Phnom Penh. Under the efforts of overcoming difficulties in Phnom Penh, he has now completed his Master's degree in Law from Build Bright University.
Involved in social work, Mr. Soeung Sotheany is a young Khmer Krom who participated in many activities for the benefit of the Khmer Krom, both monks and laity who were invited to study and live as a livelihood in Cambodia. Especially in Phnom Penh.
Mr. Soeung Sotheany or Thach Teang used to work for the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Students Union and is currently a member of the Support Committee of the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Students Union and also the Chairman of the Social Affairs Committee of the Khmer Krom Youth Council.
