(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, November 1, 2022, the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen presided over the celebration of the 11th anniversary of the operation of the Japanese company Minibia in Cambodia.
Minibia is a large Japanese company that invested in Cambodia in 2010, producing motors for export. Currently, the company also produces LED lights and toys.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen spoke for almost an hour, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* For the first time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen paid a visit to the staff of Nime Pia Company.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled that a company asked Samdech to stop Minibia investment in Cambodia in 2010. But Samdech had to confirm that Samdech could not violate Samdech's decision.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his pleasure at contributing to the growth of Minneapolis with a capital of 600 million dollars and 6,000 workers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the workers at the Minneapolis factory for their efforts in the fight against Kovid 19 and to keep the company afloat during the Kovid 19 pandemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen highlighted that at the beginning of the epidemic of Kovid 19, Cambodia was severely insulted by the international media on the fight against Kovid 19. Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned whether they were ashamed when Cambodia succeeded in fighting Kovid.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to continue to participate in the fight against Kovid 19 because it has not yet disappeared.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Capital-Provincial Governors to order smart lamps made in Cambodia to light the streets. Minibia is one of the companies that makes this smart light bulb.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has more clean energy than some countries in the region.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that Mr. Keo Rattanak brought Minibia to explore the possibility of setting up a factory in Pursat province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that human resources are an essential element for investment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the harmony between the Minibian factory and the factory workers without any explosions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen noted that harmony in Minneapolis is a good test of management. Samdech Techo instructed factories to experiment with management from Minneapolis.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is promoting a "1 plus" policy for foreign investors. Samdech is encouraging foreign investors who are investing in neighboring countries to continue to invest in Cambodia following the example of Minibia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the most important factor that leads all companies to continue to invest in Cambodia is the most needed is peace and political stability.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that three Cambodian Blue Hat soldiers were injured by a landmine in Mali.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that no investor goes to invest in a war-torn country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the near future, the Toyota car assembly plant will be present in the Phnom Penh Special Economic Zone.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2022, Samdech met with the Prime Minister of Japan four times, in which he went to Japan twice and the Prime Minister of Japan came to Cambodia twice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2023, the 70th anniversary of the relationship between the two countries, Cambodia and Japan will raise the level of relations to a strategic partnership in all aspects.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that better trade relations will improve other relations between countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed confidence that in the future, Cambodia will be more prosperous and have more investment because Cambodia is peaceful.
