Tragically, a female squirrel that was trapped and injured has died after doctors tried to save it for several days.
(Phnom Penh): It is very sad that a female squirrel that was trapped and injured died this morning, November 30, 2022, after a team of doctors tried to save for several days. Come on.
The dead animal was confirmed by veterinarians to have suffered serious injuries due to being trapped by a hunter, bruising his left abdomen and dislocating his left forearm.
