(Phnom Penh): In the afternoon of November 29, 2022, at the Ministry of Commerce, Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, led a delegation of the Ministry of Commerce to meet with Mr. Mikami Masahiro, Ambassador of Japan to Cambodia, who is about to end his term. With the Japanese delegation to pay a courtesy call and bid farewell to His Excellency the Minister of Commerce.
