Mr. Rath Sovannarak stated that as of the end of the third quarter of 2022, the assets of microfinance institutions and rural credit institutions were about 43.76 trillion riels, equivalent to 10.62 billion US dollars, of which total loans About 37.97 trillion riels, equivalent to 9.22 billion US dollars, provided more than 2.17 million customer accounts.
