(Phnom Penh): On Tuesday afternoon, November 29, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, presented a new scene in the movie Son Under the Full Moon. In this clip, a scene shows people being frightened by the South Vietnamese soldiers and sending their children to the "decision" commander to take care of them.
Samdech Techo underlined that this show shows the historical events during May 1970 when the US and South Vietnamese troops occupied Snuol district, Kratie province and National Road 7.
According to the show, during the invasion of Snuol district, the people were very afraid of the invading army because it hurt the locals, especially the daughters of the locals.
Fearing that the invading army would abuse the child, a family member who was close to the "decision" decided to send his daughter with the commander.
Please note that the scene in the movie Son Under the Full Moon, 14 clips and was shown to the public by Samdech Techo. The scene that Samdech Techo broke through received a lot of attention from the public.
