The workshop was organized under the auspices of the Cambodian Human Rights Committee and the Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) in order to disseminate, monitor and promote the implementation of the recommendations in the Commission's findings. The United Nations, the Commission on the Implementation of the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights of States Parties.
