(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Monday, November 28, 2022, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, presented a new scene in the movie Son Under the Full Moon. In this clip is a scene where the Liberation Army discusses planning to attack the Tonle Beit fort in Kampong Cham province on April 15, 1975.
Tonle Beit Fortress is a strong shield of the Republican Army, preventing the Liberation Army from invading Kampong Cham. In this scene, Commander "Samrech" describes in detail the tactics to attack the tower. The "Samrech" commander was also allowed to lead the troops in his unit to attack the tower.
It was this battle of the tower that wounded Commander "Samrech" and left his left eye on April 16, 1975.
Please note that the clip in the movie "Son under the full moon" 11 clips and was shown to the public by Samdech Techo. The scene that Samdech Techo broke through received a lot of attention from the public.
