(Phnom Penh): Prof. Lam Eng Hour, Vice Chairman of the National Medical Council, on November 26, 2022, called on all doctors to register with the Medical Council of Cambodia to practice medicine in Cambodia. .
The call was made on the occasion of Prof. Lam Eng Hour, Representative of Prof. Thea Kruy, Chairman of the National Medical Council, attending the 2022 Medical Forum at the International University on November 26, 2022.
Prof. Lam Eng Hour stated, "On behalf of the National Medical Council and on my own behalf, I would like to invite all doctors to register with the Medical Council of Cambodia to meet the conditions for practicing medicine in Cambodia." "
According to the Vice President of the National Medical Council, the provision of health services is the fulfillment of duties, which is a case of high professionalism and ethics as doctors to patients.
Prof. Lam Eng Hour confirmed that all doctors who have not yet registered with the Medical Council are not allowed to be examined and treated. And doctors must come to register with the medical board and renew the license of the medical professional development to be guaranteed to be a full and competent doctor.
