Meeting to strengthen the spirit towards the 2023 election, Samdech Techo Hun Sen highlighted the outstanding work of the Royal Government that has been achieved. Prominent work includes efforts to maintain security, order and political stability, which are essential for the building of the society and the peaceful living of the people.
In addition, the fight against the epidemic of Kovid 19, especially the introduction of vaccination strategies for the people to build good immunity, is also the success of the leadership of the Royal Government from the Cambodian People's Party.
The success of the Royal Government, which Samdech Techo highlighted, also includes maintaining economic growth, managing and responding to disasters in a timely manner. Especially when floods occur.
In addition to highlighting the great achievements of the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also highlighted some of the negative aspects of the Royal Government and the authorities that led to the resentment of the people as voters. In that, the provision of public services is still a major issue that can cause dissatisfaction to the people.
In this regard, Samdech Techo instructed the officials, authorities and local authorities who have the duty to provide services to the people to pay attention to this work by eliminating all inactivity.
Apart from this issue, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also instructed the authorities to pay attention to resolving land disputes for the people quickly. To solve this problem, Samdech Techo encouraged the use of non-judicial mechanisms.
