Mr. Kong Vibol made this statement at a special program on auditing and protesting for tax re-assessment, which was broadcast live on the Facebook page of the General Department of Taxation on November 24, 2022.
He stressed that this audit mechanism is very important for the fiscal administration in all countries to raise revenue in the medium term and to strengthen compliance and make it more competitive.
"People who pay taxes correctly should not be worried or worried about this audit, because I believe that doing business properly, there is no reason for taxpayers to go and pay taxes," he said. "The penalty is that we follow what is actually in accordance with the law as well as the conduct of regular transactions, except for those who make dishonest tax declarations, such as insufficient taxes on their operations."
An audit is a measure of the compliance of all enterprises and taxpayers, and the level of tax compliance of taxpayers is increasing due to this mechanism.
He added: "We see that the level of compliance from year to year has increased significantly due to the mechanism of the issuance and audit, and this audit is a core strategy in the strategy. "Raise medium-term income in 2019 to 2023."
In the past, the General Department of Taxation has reformed this audit several times and set up a technological audit system.
