It should be noted that after receiving the principle of unification and granting rights from the Royal Government of Cambodia, the CKFTA Agreement was officially signed in three languages: Khmer, Korean and English by the Trade Ministers of the two countries on October 26, 2021 via video system.
Cambodia ratified the bilateral agreement on January 29, 2022, while the Korean side completed its internal procedures and notified Cambodia via diplomatic note dated October 2, 2022.
