(Kampong Cham): Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly and his accompanying delegation together with Kampong Cham provincial leaders this morning, November 23, 2022, distributed government food to the poor and disadvantaged people. Landslide of 400 families in Srey Santhor district, Kampong Cham province.
