On the occasion of the opening of the 9th ASEAN Plus Defense Ministers 'Meeting at the Sokha Hotel in Siem Reap on the morning of November 23, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also mentioned that the ASEAN Plus Ministers' Meeting of Defense Plus plays an increasingly important role in Promoting mutual understanding through open exchange of views.
