In response, the Bangladeshi side emphasized the good relations between the two countries, especially the importance of promoting economic and trade cooperation. In addition, the Bangladesh side agreed to sign the Cambodia-Bangladesh Trade Agreement, the renewal of the Memorandum of Understanding on Rice Trade between Cambodia and Bangladesh and the organization of the first meeting of the Business Council. Cambodia-Bangladesh coalition.
