In the morning, Dr. Heng Sok Kong met with teachers and 12th grade students at Slapleng High School with 134 students and 30 teachers. Grade 12 students at Mongkul Borpit High School with 75 students and 21 teachers.
In the afternoon, Dr. continued to meet with teachers and students of 12th grade at Samdech Ov Samdech Mep Seth High School with 105 students and 16 teachers at 24 September High School with 91 students and teachers. 40 participating teachers.
On that occasion, Dr. Heng Sok Kong brought greetings from Mr. HUN Many to all students and wished all students to pass the exam and get good grades and thanked him. Teachers and parents of all students as well.
In addition, Dr. Heng Sok Kong also introduced and reminded some of the following content:
