Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia Receives Donation of 100 Million Riels from Donors
(Siem Reap): With the permission of the management of "Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia", the working group of the Secretariat of Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia and the management of Jayavarman VII Hospital in Siem Reap Province met with Mr. Hok Vanthina on the occasion of his leadership. The team brought 100,000,000 (one hundred million) Riels received from 50 donors to donate to the "Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia".
On that occasion, the working group of the Secretariat of Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia brought greetings and thanks from the leadership of "Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia" to Mr. Hok Vanthina and the team for the generosity and participation with the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia. The Khmer spirit helps the Khmer people and the noble spirit of participating in providing support and improving the well-being of millions of children in Cambodia.
