(Prey Veng): Mr. You Serey Vuth, Chairman of the Working Group of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Rokar Commune, Pearang District, Prey Veng Province, on Sunday, November 20, 2022, organized a public forum with the people in Roka Commune to listen to their concerns and suggestions. Blessings of the people.
Through public forums, people are open to raising local concerns and daily life. The people who participated in the forum also raised some suggestions related to the construction of roads, schools and the provision of various services.
