Mr. You Serey Vuth stated that "Cambodia has many political parties are conducting political activities in a democratic manner. But the only party that the people can rely on and always help the people in all circumstances is the CPP. "CPP officials always solve and serve the people wholeheartedly, always keep the people as a whole."
