Tycoon Try Pheap builds a medical building at Hun Sen Thmor Da Health Center worth about $ 70,000
(Pursat): Duke Dr. Try Pheap and Duke Kien Srey Neang provided a hospital and a bathroom for Hun Sen Thmor Da Health Center in Thmor Da Commune, Veal Veng District, Pursat Province. The hospital will be an important part of providing health services and health care to people in rural areas.
The hospital building is 21 meters by 15.5 meters, equal to 9 rooms. There are 8 treatment rooms that can accommodate 24 beds, 1 room for doctors, 1 waiting room and 1 bathroom equal to 6 rooms, which is planned to cost more than 70,000 US dollars. .
Prior to the start of construction on November 20, 2022, Duke Dr. Try Pheap assigned a team of experts at the company's headquarters, led by Mr. Kheang Sochivan, to inspect the construction site. The inspection of the construction site was also attended by the Director of Pursat Provincial Health Department as well as many doctors.
The Director of Pursat Provincial Health Department and the medical team at the health center expressed their deep gratitude to Duke Dr. Try Pheap and Duke Kien Srey Neang for providing this examination and treatment building. The director of the Department of Health pointed out that the examination and treatment building has responded to the needs of people in remote areas.
Please note that because the health center is close to the rocky border with Thailand is far from the city, so this health center may be turned into a referral hospital in the future.
