Criminal Police Department Arrests a Condo Sales Agent Who Seizes More Than $ 20,000 from Customers
(Phnom Penh): The light criminal bureau of the Criminal Police Department arrested a suspect who was a condominium sales agent in Koh Pich area after he extorted money from a customer who paid a monthly condominium fee but the agent did not take it. The money of its customers to pay the company, that is, put the money in their pockets.
According to the police, on August 1, 2022, the victim bought a condominium for more than $ 100,000 on Monivong Blvd., Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkar Mon, Phnom Penh, and handed over an initial payment of more than $ 30,000. The rest is paid monthly.
During January 2022, the victim handed over a monthly payment to Heng Sothearith to pay the company a total of $ 18,942 and handed over a receipt for the monthly payment to the victim. Also. Suddenly, on November 14, 2022, another salesperson contacted the victim that he had not paid for 11 months. Only then did the victim realize that the money he had given to Heng Sothearith had not been paid to the company.
After questioning, the suspect confessed that he did receive money from the victim, but did not hand it over to the company and forged the company's receipt to give the victim real trust.
