Banteay Meanchey Provincial Governor issued a policy to buy rice to apply the same as in Battambang, 1 kg price is not less than 1040 Riel for Romduol rice type 1
(Banteay Meanchey): The Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, Mr. Oum Rath, accompanied by the Director of the Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, the Director of the Provincial Department of Commerce, the District Governor, District Council, Commune Council and relevant officials met with traders and farmers at the rice collection point. In Svay Chek commune, Svay Chek district, Banteay Meanchey province, on the morning of November 18, 2022.
On that occasion, the Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province issued a policy to buy rice at the same price that traders buy in Battambang, ie not less than 1040 riels per kilogram for the first type of romduol rice.
He pointed out that the multi-provincial working group on agriculture, provincial trade, local authorities, green companies have been regularly coordinating with traders and farmers according to the goals set.
On November 17, 2022, the working group met with stakeholders including Mr. Oknha Phou Puy, Director General of Green Rice Mill, Mr. Khlok Nouy, Deputy Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, Representative of the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Representative of the Department of Commerce, Representative of the Development Bank. Agriculture and Rural Areas: District Governors, Commune Chiefs, Rice Mill Representatives and Rice Collectors supply rice mills.
Farmers from all walks of life applauded the implementation of the base price. In case of any problem with the buyer, please contact the commune chief or the Banteay Meanchey Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries at 012 838 937 for intervention.
