Ms. Mithona Phu Thong stated that the nutrition project in Cambodia is divided into three components: Part 1: Focus on strengthening the provision of health services as a priority, Part 2: Focus on promoting demand and accountability at the level Communities and Components, Third: Focus on ensuring effective and sustainable responses. The Ministry of Health is the implementing agency for the first and third components and the NCDD Secretariat is the implementing agency for the second component.
