(Kampong Chhnang): Dr. Ouk Rabun, Minister of Rural Development, on November 17, 2022, presided over the official inauguration of 116.64 km of two-story asphalt road (DBST) and a concrete road. 3.41 km symbolizes the six target provinces of the second phase of the Rural Road Improvement Project under a grant from the Government of the People's Republic of China.
