The Cambodian Fisheries Product Quality Symbol (CQS) has been introduced to certify the quality and safety of Cambodian fishery products.
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Fisheries Product Quality Symbol (CQS) has been introduced to certify the quality and safety of Cambodian fishery products in accordance with the requirements on food safety. The introduction of the CQS logo aims to contribute to better public health and market expansion for Cambodian fishery products.
Although Cambodia is an important exporter of fishery products, it has not yet been able to add value and enhance the competitiveness of its products in order to better enter the market. We can see that the contribution to Cambodia's overall exports from the fisheries sector is still small.
Gaps in food safety systems in the entire fishery price chain are a factor that importers do not have enough faith in that Cambodia's quality management system can ensure the supply of safe and good quality fishery products for domestic consumers. Import.
Has Sareth, Secretary of State for the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, said the official launch of CQS is another important achievement that he hopes will further support the fishing industry, especially the fishery processing industry, to expand its business. Meet and meet the food safety requirements of regional and international markets.
Mr. Pum Sotha, the Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of Fisheries Administration, emphasized that the success of the implementation of the CQS certification system will help promote the Cambodian national brand by recognizing the quality and safety of products that use the CQS logo, which will promote Competitiveness of Cambodian fishery products.
"We expect it to contribute to the international trade in Cambodian fishery products, as well as to protect public health," said Pum Sotha.
Mr. Mieu Sokkry, President of the Cambodian Food Producers Association (CFMA), stated, “I would like to encourage all enterprises to join and support the CQS certification system to build a national brand for Cambodian fishery products. "I strongly believe that the CQS system will enhance and protect the enterprise's reputation from product recalls due to security issues as well as financial losses."
He added that the CQS system can help build customer confidence and increase access to both domestic and foreign markets. The CQS system will help enterprises become more competitive, more profitable, and more sustainable.
