At the same time, many of our political leaders are expressing their feelings that the epidemic is a loss. In May 2022, the CDC introduced its new so-called "community level" in an inconsistent effort to undermine the reality of continuing high levels of Kovid infection. Create a reassurance map that is mostly green.
