According to Kheang Huot's complaint, several markets in Sihanoukville stole the company's counterfeit goods on November 15-16. In 2022, representatives of Kheang Huot Company and CPP officials inspected those markets and found many traders who were selling counterfeit goods of Kheang Huot Company.
After discovering the counterfeit goods of Kheang Huot Company, the CPP officials did not fine the traders, only educated them to stop selling those goods.
