The exhibition was held on the morning of November 16-18, 2022 at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center, Phnom Penh. The inauguration ceremony was presided over by Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism and attended by Mr. Leang Monirith, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction and Mr. Lou Meng, President of the Cambodian Tourism Federation.
