Cambodia's historical record After the break-up of the famous Angkorian Empire, the Khmers always had conflicts within their nation, and every time there was a conflict, they always ran to depend on neighboring countries or other countries to seize territory or end conflicts. At the same time, the Cambodian conflict of about five decades ago to take an end to take a long time, and we also ran to rely on other countries and nations to help end this conflict.
However, since the unification and achievement of complete peace in late 1998 under the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Royal Government has integrated foreign policy into the region and made Cambodia an important partner. Solve the problems of other countries.
Obviously, now Cambodia is not a country that runs to rely on people to help solve its problems like in the past, instead, Cambodia has contributed to concessions, ideas, intelligence and other resources to solve the problems of other countries. . This is a process of great change between Cambodia's past and present.
The second correctness is the introduction of Samdech Techo's foreign policy line, which included Cambodia as a member of ASEAN about 23 years ago, as well as the membership of all international organizations.
It is this correctness of internal and external factors that has led to Cambodia's reputation and prestige for the entire Cambodian nation. The entire Cambodian people have been expressing their deep gratitude and admiration for the internal and external policies of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, bringing historical pride for the entire Cambodian nation.
