(Svay Rieng): Residents living near National Road 13, Preah Tonle Village, Sangkat Sangkor, Svay Rieng City, Svay Rieng Province have asked the authorities to protest the land exploitation company and stop its activities because this business activity caused damage to the twin roads. About 80 meters long, which people use to shout and plant crops.
