With these achievements, Samdech Techo welcomed and highly appreciated the practical progress of the implementation, revision, implementation of the Declaration of Vision on ASEAN-Japan Friendship and Cooperation, One Vision, One Identity and One Future.
He also said that in 2023, the 50th anniversary of the ASEAN-Japan Summit, the ASEAN-Japan Friendship and Cooperation Summit will be held in Tokyo.
Samdech Techo considers this event to open a new page in history for the relationship between ASEAN and Japan.
