With the many achievements that Cambodia is having under the umbrella of peace brought by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Mr. I Leang added that Cambodia has sufficient capacity to organize and lead summits, such as the ASEAN Summit. And related meetings, which reflect the potential of leading human resources with a potential and favorable environment.
Taking that opportunity, he also urged people of all ages to go and register to vote and check the names of everyone, especially to vote for the Cambodian People's Party in the upcoming 2023 National Assembly election. This is to continue to maintain the peace and political stability that exists today.
