Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued that, in fact, history has shown that no matter what the circumstances, ASEAN Plus Three always adheres to the spirit of unity. To this day, the success of the ASEAN Plus Three cooperation comes from our relentless efforts of close operation and strong solidarity.
The ASEAN Plus Three (APT) process began in December 1997 and has since evolved into an important mechanism for promoting East Asian cooperation towards the long-term goals of the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN). Building an East Asian community with ASEAN as the driving force.
APT has become one of the most comprehensive cooperation frameworks in the region, and APT continues to expand and deepen in many areas, including politics, security, trade and investment, finance, energy, tourism, agriculture and forestry. Environment, education, health, culture and the arts. APT also supports the implementation of the ASEAN Community Vision 2025.
