Senior NEC official: Seoul International Forum on Elections will provide a good experience for the Cambodian NEC
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Som Soreida, Advisor and Deputy Secretary General of the National Election Committee (NEC), expressed his belief that the Seoul International Forum on the 2022 Election will provide a good experience for the NEC. Cambodia to improve the modernization of the electoral process.
At the invitation of the National Election Committee (NEC) of the Republic of Korea, the NEC of the Kingdom of Cambodia has assigned 15 NEC officials, led by Mr. Som Soreida, to attend the international forum. Seoul 2022 election on teleconferencing video conference (Zoom) on the afternoon of November 10, 2022.
The 7th Annual Forum is held under the theme "Democracy: Response to Electoral Climate Change" with two themes:
* Responding to changes in the electoral environment caused by the development of digital technology * Challenges in promoting youth participation in politics
According to a press release obtained by Fresh News on November 11, 2022, Mr. Som Soreida noted after the end of this international forum that the forum is in line with the modernization of the organizing process. The Cambodian election, organized by the NEC, is based on the development of information technology, which has been officially launched since 2016. These computer system upgrades include:
* Voter Registration Manager * Political Party Candidate Registration Manager * Voter Registration Document * Voter Verification and Summarization Program
He pointed out that for 2023, the NEC will launch two more programs: the Voter Statistics Management Program and the Computer Voting Information Security and Security Management Program.
