The ASEAN Business and Business Summit 2022 was organized by the ASEAN Business Advisory Council, chaired by Duke Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and President of the ASEAN Business Advisory Council, under the theme: “Addressing All Challenges "Held" in Phnom Penh, Kingdom of Cambodia.
On this occasion, Prime Minister Pham Minh Chinh also shared four key points to work together to build and increase confidence and build a machine for regional and global economic recovery. These include:
Second, the ASEAN Business Community must seize the opportunity provided by the RCEP as it accounts for 30% of GDP and global population. RCEP provides access to a large market and serves as a catalyst for expanding market connectivity and developing production and value chains. It also facilitates regulations on the origin of customs duties, inspections and technical standards.
Third, ASEAN members should effectively implement the joint strategy on the Fourth Industrial Revolution and the ASEAN Agreement on E-Commerce. It is also necessary to vigorously promote digital transformation and increase investment in the development of digital infrastructure, thereby facilitating regional connectivity and economic recovery.
Fourth, the ASEAN Bank must continue to play a pioneering role in the joint efforts of the ASEAN Business Community to promote public-private partnerships, increase innovation and accelerate technology transfer. This will contribute to reducing the transition to a better circular economic model, saving resources, ensuring environmental protection and promoting socio-economic recovery and development.
At the same time, Prime Minister Pham Minh Chinh said that Vietnam maintains a consistent foreign policy of independence, self-reliance, peace, friendship, cooperation, development and multilateralism, and diversification of external relations. Vietnam is a good friend, a reliable partner and a responsible member of the international community. We uphold and respect the principles of ASEAN.
Please be informed that the ASEAN Business Summit 2022 was officially opened on the morning of November 10, 2022 under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
