"Under the auspices of four national hospitals: Calmette Hospital, Soviet-Soviet Friendship Hospital, Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital, Preah Kosomak Hospital, Preah Ang Duong Hospital, as well as the Phnom Penh Municipal and Provincial Health Departments," he said. "In the middle, we used 35 ambulances, 140 doctors and two large ambulances."
