Lt. Gen. Meas Bun Ley's remarks were made on the occasion that he, along with Neak Oknha Ly Samet, Samdech Techo Hun Sen's personal advisor and Samdech Techo Hun Sen's representative, marched on Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen. Holding Sala Andet pagoda in Andong village, Kraing Yov commune, Srong Saang district, Kandal province on November 08, 2022 yesterday.
