(Preah Sihanouk): Police in Preah Sihanouk province have cracked down on a group of six thieves who have already planned to steal and rob local people. The break-up of the robbers' plan came after police arrested a suspected ringleader on the night of November 9, 2022 in Village 3, Sangkat 1, Sihanoukville.
The General Commissioner said that the Criminal Planning Office of the Sihanoukville Provincial Police visited the house of the suspect, named Nolida, alias Pros, and found an original handgun and a motorbike.
