Mr. Kieng Leak, Governor of Chamkarmon District, ordered Mr. HOT Vanthy and Mr. Mao Boneth, Deputy Governor of Chamkarmon District to lead a working group to inspect and personally guide Makhs at 14 nightclub locations in Village 14 and Village 15, Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkarmon. In order for the owners of these locations to receive instructions and cooperate with the authorities to ensure that all of those locations are temporarily suspended.
