This evening, the Prime Minister of Cambodia and Vietnam opened the Cambodia-Vietnam Investment and Trade Promotion Forum 2022
(Phnom Penh): At around 5 pm on Tuesday, November 8, 2022, Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen and his Vietnamese counterpart Pham Minh Chinh presided over the opening of the Cambodia-Vietnam Investment and Trade Promotion Forum 2022.
Cambodia and Vietnam are both villages with active trade activities, and Vietnam is also a country that invests a lot in Cambodia. Vietnam is the fourth largest investor in Cambodia after China, South Korea and Singapore.
Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, said that the Cambodia-Vietnam Business Forum on this occasion is very important in sharing important progress related to business opportunities and investment and investment between Cambodia and Vietnam.
