Comment: The world looks forward to the opening of the China International Import and Export Fair, and the China International Import and Export Fair is favorable to the whole world.
In Kabul, the capital of Afghanistan, recently, the owner of a factory called Hakazad was very anxious, so he contacted his partner in Shanghai, which is often far away. Sell its products in the Chinese market, relying on the occasion of the 5th China International Import and Export Fair, because this will determine the future and fate of his factory.
The factory, which is operated by Hakazad, is essentially a traditional Afghan handicraft with a long history. But in recent years, the effects of the 19-epidemic of Kovid and the political turmoil in Afghanistan have caused businesses to plummet.
Over the past five years, the China International Import and Export Fair has changed the lives of countless people and brought them opportunities and hopes. After listening to Hakazad's story, you will probably know exactly why this solemn international event is filling the world with expectations.
