(Preah Vihear): Preah Vihear provincial authorities claim that there is no roadblock and take money from farmers to transport crops across the road to the Chinese sugarcane company to sell in the markets.
On the morning of November 6, 2022, Mr. Ong Vuthy, Deputy Governor of Preah Vihear Province, on behalf of Mr. Kim Rithy, Deputy Governor of Preah Vihear Province, led a working group of relevant competent authorities and local authorities to inspect Chamkar Ampov Road. China, a place where the media and social media have been spreading these days.
The Deputy Governor stated that the actual inspections of the provincial, district and relevant working groups at this time found that there was nothing like the media. The survey shows that about 20 to 30 families are enjoying and collecting potatoes to sell in the market, usually without any coercion from the company, that is, people can sell their products anywhere.
Regarding the placement of barricades across the road of the Chinese sugarcane plantation company, Mr. Ung Vuthy stated that the company just wanted to check how many families have land titles or no land titles in the company? For people who have a land title in the company is free to enter and exit.
He said that the barracks is a private road of the company, and this placement is to easily manage the company's investment land of more than 6,000 hectares, and after the harvest, people without land titles in the company can not cultivate. Invade the company land anymore.
Mr. Ung Vuthy further stated that the company has not leased land to any person in the past, as the company has problems leaving vacant land, people from all over have come to cultivate and enjoy, and in 2023, the company will resume investment. .
As for the construction of the canal canal, it is for the safety of the company's land, and in the past, the provincial and district authorities have coordinated the priority roads for people to travel. He said that in conclusion, the previous advertisement was not true and the company security did not take money from the people for registration, yes, just want to know where he really has land in the company?
For people who enjoy one hectare or two hectares of company land, the provincial and district authorities have facilitated the company not to take money during the harvest and will not allow him to cultivate on the company's investment land because in 2023 The company will resume operations soon.
Russian President Vladimir Putin has signed a law to convict Russian citizens convicted of murder and robbery (Video inside) (Moscow) Drug trafficking and other serious crimes are covered under the Russian Federal Penal Code to enlist in the military. This was released by CNN on Sunday, November 6, 2022.
According to Russian media, prior to Putin's signing, the perpetrators of the above-mentioned crimes were barred from serving in the military. In addition, perpetrators of sexual offenses against minors, traitors, spies or terrorists are exempt from the law, while those convicted of attempted murder of Russian government officials, hijackers and extremists are not counted. Included in this law.
