(Pursat): Mr. Keo Rattanak, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister, Director General of Electricite du Cambodge and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group for Local Assistance in Krakor and Kandieng Districts, on the afternoon of November 5, 2022 878 students are preparing for the 2022 high school exam in Bakan district, including 321 students at Bakan High School, 235 students at Preah Mlou High School, 110 students at Romlech High School and 212 students at Otapong High School.
