(Kandal): Duke Try Pheap, General Director of Try Pheap Group and a personal advisor to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, highlighted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian People's Party are the main players who led Bring development and prosperity for Cambodia. In particular, bring a strong reputation of Cambodia on regional and international forums.
Duke Try Pheap said this during a meeting with 2,322 members and activists of the Cambodian People's Party in Kandal Stung district on Sunday morning, November 6, 2022.
In front of a large number of party members as well as party activists, Duke Try Pheap brought a message from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party. The tycoon emphasized that although Samdech Techo was busy with the big work of the nation, Samdech Techo always missed the people everywhere and advised the party working group to hold social gatherings and greetings regularly.
In addition to showing the progress of the nation, Duke Try Pheap also highlighted the intervention of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who suffered from floods during the rainy season this year, Samdech Techo visited the victims directly. And provided rice seeds for replanting rice as well as providing food to solve the hardships of the affected people.
The duke also mentioned the success of the Royal Government led by Samdech Techo in the fight against Kovid 19, save the lives of the people and reopen the economy quickly through the policy of vaccination. For Duke Try Pheap, without Samdech Techo's leadership and a clear policy, Cambodia would not have been able to escape the 19 epidemic of Kovid.
In addition to highlighting the need to build a society to deal with floods and Kovid 19, Duke Try Pheap also highlighted Cambodia's prestige on the international stage through its foreign policy led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen. The duke said that next week, Cambodia, as chair of ASEAN, will host the ASEAN Summit and related meetings, which will be attended by many world-renowned leaders, including the President of the United States.
For the duke, the opportunity to host the ASEAN Summit and related meetings is a success of Cambodia's foreign policy and also brings honor to the Cambodian nation and people. The duke highlighted that in the past, Cambodia was plagued by war as a weakened country, but now Cambodia has a more important role and has contributed to solving the world's problems.
The above-mentioned achievements, the duke claimed, could not have happened without the right leadership. Therefore, this is an achievement born of the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, who always thinks and pays the highest attention to the nation and the people of Cambodia.
On that occasion, Duke Try Pheap reminded the people to check the voter list and to instruct all children of voting age to register to vote in order to have the right to vote in 2023.
