Heart as a Savior makes Kun Kim receive the title of "Honorary Doctor" full of honor
(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, His Majesty the King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, is pleased to present the "Honorary Doctorate" of the Royal Academy of Cambodia to Senior Minister Kun Kim Anou. First Chairman, National Committee for Disaster Management.
Honorary title "Honorary Doctor" means an honorable and generous doctor in saving others.
This honorable mention demonstrates the King's willingness and the Prime Minister of Cambodia's Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen's deep devoted efforts to the nation and its people. As the staff of Samdech Techo and the operator on the battlefield of disaster.
Kun Kim is a senior officer of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, with the rank of General and former Joint Chiefs of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces. As a General of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, he worked tirelessly in the cause of national defense, territorial integrity and national sovereignty.
In 2018, the new government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen transferred Kun Kim from the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces to a civilian position, giving him the position of Senior Minister in charge of special missions.
By the end of 2019, Senior Minister Kun Kim was trusted by Samdech Techo Hun Sen to be the first Vice Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management. After assuming the role of First Vice President of the National Committee for Disaster Management, the first job that came to greet him was the collapse of a building in Kep in early 2020.
As Samdech Techo's staff and operator on the battlefield, Kun Kim did not delay, he immediately flew by helicopter to the scene to stand and manage and search for victims under the building. Until the transaction is completed.
In 2020, the beginning of the year was greeted by the collapse of buildings, and by the end of the year, he was greeted by floods. 2020 is a year in which Cambodia experiences severe flooding, both river floods and torrential rains. River floods inundated northeastern provinces, while torrential rains inundated northwestern provinces such as Banteay Meanchey, Battambang and Pursat.
Disaster operators' responsible, fast and responsible operation makes the intervention and problem solving of the people quick and timely. Fast and responsible operations have made a significant contribution to warming the hearts of flood victims.
In addition to the major incidents mentioned above, there are problems of some people, such as the case of people falling into the mountains in Battambang province, the sinking of a boat in Leuk Dek district, etc. It was observed that Senior Minister Kun Kim took care Keep high down to the scene to lead the rescue and search operation.
In his role as the person in charge of the National Committee for Disaster Management, after the direct guidance of Samdech Techo Prime Minister, who is the Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management, Senior Minister Kun Kim also led the organization to increase the rescue operation force as well. Equip technical equipment to the forces to make disaster relief operations more efficient.
Overall, in his role as a disaster rescuer for the past three years, Kun Kim has been seen as the most responsible and loyal rescue operator. He sacrificed his physical and mental strength in the cause of the disaster to help solve the difficulties of the Royal Government and the people every time there is a disaster.
Through his role in the National Committee for Disaster Management and the Cambodian Veterans Association, he expressed the deep and generous feelings of Senior Minister Kun Kim towards the Cambodian people and veterans.
Through the work activities within these two institutions, Senior Minister Kun Kim has received great respect and admiration from Cambodians of all walks of life.
The awarding of the title of "Honorary Doctor" by His Majesty the King of Life in Response to the Gems of Samdech Techo Hun Sen is the most deserving honor in return for the achievements and merits that Senior Minister Kun Kim Serve the nation and the people with deep sincerity.
With this honorable mention, Senior Minister Kun Kim was warmly welcomed and congratulated by the leaders of the Royal Government, as well as government officials and the Armed Forces.
